From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tomaz Zaman <tomaz@mono.si>
Date: Thu, 23 Apr 2026 17:55:41 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] wireless: restore ndo_do_ioctl dispatch in wext-core

Restores the wext_handle_ioctl path's call to ndo_do_ioctl on drivers
that haven't migrated to the newer cfg80211 path. Unrelated to the ASK
offload stack; carried here because the ASK tree's out-of-tree wifi
driver (ath10k vendor fork) still uses the old hook. Downstream
integrators using a different wifi stack can drop this patch.

Also enables WEXT_PRIV by default in net/wireless/Kconfig so the
out-of-tree driver's iwstats interface works without manual Kconfig
surgery (Linux 6.18 removed WEXT_SPY).

Signed-off-by: Tomaz Zaman <tomaz@mono.si>
---
 net/wireless/Kconfig     | 4 ++--
 net/wireless/wext-core.c | 3 +++
 2 files changed, 5 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/net/wireless/Kconfig b/net/wireless/Kconfig
index 2d67b5f2010ed..5e142e5a1923d 100644
--- a/net/wireless/Kconfig
+++ b/net/wireless/Kconfig
@@ -1,6 +1,6 @@
 # SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-only
 config WIRELESS_EXT
-	bool
+	def_bool y
 
 config WEXT_CORE
 	def_bool y
@@ -12,7 +12,7 @@ config WEXT_PROC
 	depends on WEXT_CORE
 
 config WEXT_PRIV
-	bool
+	def_bool y
 
 config CFG80211
 	tristate "cfg80211 - wireless configuration API"
diff --git a/net/wireless/wext-core.c b/net/wireless/wext-core.c
index 7b8e94214b072..ce7dfce6d9445 100644
--- a/net/wireless/wext-core.c
+++ b/net/wireless/wext-core.c
@@ -982,6 +982,9 @@ static int wireless_process_ioctl(struct net *net, struct iwreq *iwr,
 		else if (private)
 			return private(dev, iwr, cmd, info, handler);
 	}
+	/* Old driver API : call driver ioctl handler */
+	if (dev->netdev_ops->ndo_do_ioctl)
+		return dev->netdev_ops->ndo_do_ioctl(dev, (struct ifreq *)iwr, cmd);
 	return -EOPNOTSUPP;
 }
 
